      "content": "Alright. So pricing very simple the hourly rate on Tuesday is $208 for two movers. Everything's included there, the gas and the truck taxes and insurance. We also wrap your furniture for protection when being moved and we also disassemble and reassemble furniture, and even appliances. The only thing outside of the hourly rate is a one time trip fee of $672. Since cypress is outside of our free service zone, that trip fee covers the drive from cypress, going back to Austin then we don't have any hidden fees here. There are no credit card fees, no stable fees, notice, assembly and reassembly fees, too. Then we have a two and a half hour minimum for any move. Once we go over the minimum, the time is prorated in fifteen minute increments.",
